==> AGENTS.md#context-rules <==
Detailed guides live in `.cursor/rules/`. Cursor loads them automatically for matching files; other agents should read the matching guides before editing:

- `templates/**`: `seo-requirements.mdc`, `templates.mdc`, `i18n.mdc`, `features.mdc`
- `content/**`: `i18n.mdc`, `shortcodes.mdc`, `features.mdc`, `private-collections.mdc`
- `data/i18n/**`: `i18n.mdc`
- `data/**`: `data-files.mdc`
- `templates/shortcodes/**`: `shortcodes.mdc`
- `seite.toml`: `config-reference.mdc`, `private-collections.mdc`

